        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap, dash, and vault through an endless adrenaline rush!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform Vault is a <strong>high-stakes infinite runner</strong> where hesitation means disaster. Every jump is permanent <strong>no turning back</strong> as platforms shift, and crumble beneath you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong> - Test your endurance in an ever-accelerating gauntlet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack</strong> - Race against the clock in a blistering sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Mode</strong> - Wild, unpredictable platforms for maximum chaos</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>new character</strong> and <strong>cosmetics</strong> with in-run gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated <strong>platforms with unique behaviors</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Challenge Yourself</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on <strong>global leaderboards</strong></p></li></ul>",
